=To: {{ $('Outcome').item.json.to_email }}
Template: {{ $('Outcome').item.json.template_key }}
Outcome: {{ $('Outcome').item.json.outcome }}
Reason: {{ $('Outcome').item.json.error }}
Row id: {{ $('Outcome').item.json.id }}

failed means Resend refused it and nothing was sent. uncertain means it may have been sent. Nothing is retried automatically. To send again: select requeue_outbound_email('{{ $('Outcome').item.json.id }}');

